  "content": {
    "id": "p8-q9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "The diagonal of a cube measures $20\\text{ m}$. Calculate the following, rounding your answers to 1 decimal place.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p8-q9-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "The volume of the cube.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1539.6\\text{ m}^3$",
          "worked": "Let the edge length be $s$ metres and a face diagonal be $f$ metres.\n$$\\begin{aligned}f^2&=s^2+s^2\\\\f^2&=2s^2\\\\20^2&=s^2+f^2\\\\400&=3s^2\\\\s&=\\frac{20}{\\sqrt3}\\\\V&=\\left(\\frac{20}{\\sqrt3}\\right)^3\\\\V&\\approx1539.6\\text{ m}^3\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p8-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "The surface area of the cube.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$800.0\\text{ m}^2$",
          "worked": "Using $s^2=\\dfrac{400}{3}$ from part a:\n$$\\begin{aligned}S&=6s^2\\\\S&=6\\times\\frac{400}{3}\\\\S&=800.0\\text{ m}^2\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      }
    ]
  },
